WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Scan the business QR code to start the review journey.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Ai generates an editable review draft.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Shuffle the drafts and choose words that match your experience.

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
Copy your chosen review, then open Google.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Paste your review and choose to post it yourself on Google.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Stars rise from the phone. This is an illustrative demonstration.
